    "description": "\nA mod that increases the schematic size limit to 512 blocks! Adds admins, renderer and building tools. Has an updater, keybinds and AI support.\n[red]This mod is not the original port of Scheme Size — it is a custom port. The developer of the original mod is not involved in this in any way.\n[red]!!!ATTENTION: VERSIONS BELOW v159 ARE NOT SUPPORTED!!!\n[red]Vanilla Only![orange]\n\n   - Release!\n   - Settings\n   - Java 8\n   - Controls\n   - Updater\n   - Mobile Support\n   - Admins Tools\n\n   - Building Tools\n   - AI Power\n   - Renderer Tools\n   - Deep Cleaning\n   - Schematic Shortcuts\n   - Cursed Schematics\n   - Advanced Dev Console\n   - Rule setter\n",
